Manufacturing sales and use tax exemption-
HB0011
amendments.
Sponsored By: Joint Minerals, Business & Economic Development
Interim Committee
AN ACT relating to taxation and revenue; extending the sunset date for the
manufacturing sales tax and use tax exemptions; repealing provisions for the
manufacturing use tax exemption to align with the manufacturing sales tax
exemption; and providing for an effective date.
